'''Nesingwary's Expedition''' is a small hunting [[camp]] in [[Stranglethorn Vale]]. It is situated just below the river north of [[Lake Nazferiti]]. The [[dwarven]] master [[hunter]] [[Hemet Nesingwary]] has led an expedition into Stranglethorn to hunt some of the wild game that traverse the jungles.

